  "proposals": {
    "_comment": [
      "Gate-tier lines no script names yet: the new starters and legendaries. A",
      "gate line is never placed in the wild, so each needs a static battle, a",
      "gift or an egg, which is script work outside this track (decision 8).",
      "These are the agent's proposals for where; Ian accepts one by writing the",
      "script, or changes the tier. The plan counts a proposed line as sourced",
      "on paper and the document lists them under For Ian."
    ],
    "SPECIES_SNIVY": "gift, a second starter house like the base ROM's Hearthome fan club (Charmander, Squirtle): Eterna Condominiums",
    "SPECIES_FENNEKIN": "gift, with Snivy and Froakie: Eterna Condominiums, pick one of three",
    "SPECIES_FROAKIE": "gift, with Snivy and Fennekin: Eterna Condominiums, pick one of three",
    "SPECIES_ROWLET": "gift, pick one of three with Litten and Popplio: Pastoria",
    "SPECIES_LITTEN": "gift, pick one of three with Rowlet and Popplio: Pastoria",
    "SPECIES_POPPLIO": "gift, pick one of three with Rowlet and Litten: Pastoria",
    "SPECIES_SCORBUNNY": "gift, pick one of two with Sprigatito: Snowpoint",
    "SPECIES_SPRIGATITO": "gift, pick one of two with Scorbunny: Snowpoint",
    "SPECIES_GALARIAN_ARTICUNO": "roamer, released with the Kanto birds by Oak, or static in Snowpoint Temple B5F after Regigigas",
    "SPECIES_GALARIAN_ZAPDOS": "roamer, released with the Kanto birds by Oak, or static on Route 225's peak",
    "SPECIES_GALARIAN_MOLTRES": "roamer, released with the Kanto birds by Oak, or static on Stark Mountain's outside",
    "SPECIES_XERNEAS": "static, post-League, Sendoff Spring's shrine (the life tree by the spring)",
    "SPECIES_YVELTAL": "static, post-League, Route 224's shrine stone, the mirror of Xerneas",
    "SPECIES_ZYGARDE_10": "static, the deepest of Turnback Cave's post-game rooms (unknown_557), as the 10% form",
    "SPECIES_DIANCIE": "static, Wayward Cave 1F, Carbink's home: a 1-in-the-cave event after the League",
    "SPECIES_TAPU_KOKO": "static, post-League, Valley Windworks (the electric shrine)",
    "SPECIES_TAPU_LELE": "static, post-League, Solaceon Ruins room 7",
    "SPECIES_TAPU_BULU": "static, post-League, Floaroma Meadow",
    "SPECIES_TAPU_FINI": "static, post-League, Lake Verity's island",
    "SPECIES_NIHILEGO": "static, Turnback Cave post-game rooms (unknown_533), the Ultra Beasts as the cave's invaders",
